{"title":"2023 SSMO Speed Round Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_SSMO_Speed_Round_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/f/eef36d8b3c71cd00802eb6c16c99f2b131d5e28f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F_1 = F_2 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"95\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/a/2ba1b96c5a8886d1b566ea7560181e22e43f73ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F_n = F_{n-1} + F_{n-2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"141\" height=\"15\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/a/47affecc93688552c8eca8bc13560d52b4cc28a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\geq 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" /> be the Fibonacci numbers. If distinct positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/8/9a874baf27c19c605e774298d3e38a4dddc2d318.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1, a_2, \\dots a_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"95\" height=\"13\" /> satisfies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/8/0787e8d78aa455ee6c77441674ff7e39f65d62f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F_{a_1}+F_{a_2}+\\dots+F_{a_n}=2023$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"231\" height=\"19\" />, find the minimum possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/8/8981aaf16e66c7ded7482dbfce5d9036aeb02bea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1+a_2+\\dots+a_n.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"148\" height=\"15\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_SSMO_Speed_Round_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/0/600301908ddda69bf710c8afdbb89a806e020e9c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1 &lt; a_2 &lt; \\dots &lt; a_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"149\" height=\"15\" /> are taken such\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/e/c1ec069d0201e6de88c8b523e3b9de0fff04beed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1 + a_2 + \\dots + a_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"142\" height=\"15\" /> is minimal and\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/c/2eca926fa627df1b13102cb171b7c8f43ea8d27b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[F_{a_1} + F_{a_2} + \\dots + F_{a_n} = 2023\\]\" width=\"227\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>Then, there are no consecutive <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/2/412787c048e28774dc63fc27db42dc52ca858de7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/c/bac5179cf12e1a7ff085b57db0ca3f9d9c2e6e9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{i+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"29\" height=\"12\" /> such\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/9/d19b1204823824eb2521839b3f827e8f0d6e98bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_i + 1 = a_{i+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"104\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Generalize <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/7/0873e9fed23538e535ac05c3284b86bd7bce6fd6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2023$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> to any <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/1/411e8b2b30fbb26e55ed0d28303d10fa81aa5606.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k &gt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" />.\nLet <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> be maximal such <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/7/e57600f88d221f067fed8d959f813cdbe9316aad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F_a &lt; k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"56\" height=\"17\" />\nWe claim that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/7/0f7b6bbc3a11aba1f1473eec4e6c52a6d916840b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n = a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> is a Fibonacci number the result follows.\n</p><p>Note that \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/c/d4c398a1dbf1048e189830f6485d9ce32e10e848.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[F_{2n+1} = F_{2n} + F_{2n-2} + \\dots + F_2 + 1\\]\" width=\"277\" height=\"17\" />\nand\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/a/faa80303ccec71a052680b62bbe3d0331ed2a8ea.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[F_{2n+2} = F_{2n+1} + F_{2n-1} + \\dots + F_1\\]\" width=\"261\" height=\"17\" />\nfollow inductively.\n</p><p>Thus, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/8/d588e74ce5ef8c77f8dd288a3ee7a6dc1e160dc8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n \\ne a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"18\" /> then\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/5/505bfc5e5ad89760eb52f8bb05a7eaba671b931b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[F_{a_1} + F_{a_2} + \\dots + F_{a_n} \\le F_a &lt; k,\\]\" width=\"250\" height=\"17\" />\ncontradiction.\n</p><p>Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/1/6f1a2b6b7c193f9ba2b2134a59f1da5addcfbc98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" /> be must maximal so we can reduce greedily to get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/6/3165fcd6e1e0190b23baa93dda8b2a9ec9993303.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2023 = F_{17} + F_{14} + F_9 + F_7 + F_3\\]\" width=\"256\" height=\"15\" />\nand the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/3/153cad62622d1c8d3136469e6b50d5f9354190e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17 + 14 + 9 + 7 + 3 = \\boxed{50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"208\" height=\"25\" />\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017230045\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.022 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 92/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4655/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:24754:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017230045 and revision id 195183. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}